sequenceDiagram
	autonumber
	actor User
	participant UI as StockTracker UI
	participant App as app.js
	participant Config as config.js
	participant AV as Alpha Vantage API
	participant TD as Twelve Data API
	participant LS as localStorage

	User->>UI: Enter company name or symbol
	UI->>App: submit search query
	App->>App: validate input

	alt Query looks like a symbol
		App->>Config: read API key
		App->>AV: GET GLOBAL_QUOTE?symbol=SYMBOL&apikey=...
		alt Alpha Vantage returns a valid quote
			AV-->>App: quote payload
			App->>App: normalize quote data
			App->>UI: render stock details
			App->>LS: save quote cache
		else Alpha Vantage limit reached or fails
			App->>TD: GET time_series?symbol=SYMBOL&interval=1min&apikey=...
			alt Twelve Data returns a valid quote
				TD-->>App: time series payload
				App->>App: normalize Twelve Data quote data
				App->>UI: render stock details
				App->>LS: save quote cache
			else Both live quote services fail
				App->>App: use local fallback quote
				App->>UI: render stock details
				App->>LS: save quote cache
			end
		end
	else Query looks like a company name
		App->>Config: read API key
		App->>AV: GET SYMBOL_SEARCH?keywords=NAME&apikey=...
		AV-->>App: matching symbols
		App->>UI: render selectable matches
		User->>UI: choose symbol
		UI->>App: lookup selected symbol
		App->>Config: read API key
		App->>AV: GET GLOBAL_QUOTE?symbol=SYMBOL&apikey=...
		alt Alpha Vantage returns a valid quote
			AV-->>App: quote payload
			App->>App: normalize quote data
			App->>UI: render stock details
			App->>LS: save quote cache
		else Alpha Vantage limit reached or fails
			App->>TD: GET time_series?symbol=SYMBOL&interval=1min&apikey=...
			alt Twelve Data returns a valid quote
				TD-->>App: time series payload
				App->>App: normalize Twelve Data quote data
				App->>UI: render stock details
				App->>LS: save quote cache
			else Both live quote services fail
				App->>App: use local fallback quote
				App->>UI: render stock details
				App->>LS: save quote cache
			end
		end
	end

	opt Update shares owned
		User->>UI: enter share count
		UI->>App: save shares
		App->>LS: persist portfolio shares
		App->>UI: refresh position value and totals
	end

	opt Portfolio reset
		User->>UI: click Portfolio Reset
		UI->>App: reset portfolio
		App->>LS: remove portfolio key
		App->>UI: reload page
	end

	opt Add or remove watchlist item
		User->>UI: toggle watchlist button
		UI->>App: update watchlist
		App->>LS: persist watchlist symbols
		App->>UI: refresh watchlist and summary
	end
